            "detailed_description": "<h1>Comparison Grid</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/8f5e3d73d24f7bd971f67f3cfffaf627.avif?t=1782421726\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><br><h1>Definitive Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/0803a800e7dfea4dc9f7ab03e0a23ecb.avif?t=1782421726\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tenha a experiência completa de The Division com esta Definitive Edition! O jogo base, as três expansões de Passe de Temporada e vários pacotes de itens estéticos esperam por você. </p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Restaure a ordem e construa a Cidade de Nova York depois de uma pandemia devastadora neste jogo de tiro tático de mundo aberto em terceira pessoa:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combate Tático</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/961b4fc08fadd20bc0e80bf70290b55f.poster.avif?t=1782421726\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/961b4fc08fadd20bc0e80bf70290b55f.webm?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/961b4fc08fadd20bc0e80bf70290b55f.mp4?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Mobilize-se contra inimigos em tiroteios intensos com cobertura onde o posicionamento inteligente e uso de utilidade vencem batalhas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progressão Extensa de Equipamento</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/58dda64d84fee72b78a5af315ffeaa76.poster.avif?t=1782421726\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/58dda64d84fee72b78a5af315ffeaa76.webm?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/58dda64d84fee72b78a5af315ffeaa76.mp4?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Saqueie, fabrique e melhore armas e blindagem para criar o agente definitivo para o seu estilo de jogo.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mundo Aberto Envolvente</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/19461dbf29675f9f5febc2c1889775d2.poster.avif?t=1782421726\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/19461dbf29675f9f5febc2c1889775d2.webm?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/19461dbf29675f9f5febc2c1889775d2.mp4?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Clima dinâmico, ciclos de dia/noite e ambientes urbanos realistas criam uma experiência envolvente de sobrevivência nas vizinhanças mais icônicas da Manhattan pós-apocalíptica.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Solo ou Cooperativo</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/6d5c2642bd8d2325963f69bceb215876.poster.avif?t=1782421726\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/6d5c2642bd8d2325963f69bceb215876.webm?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/6d5c2642bd8d2325963f69bceb215876.mp4?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Encare as missões da história solo ou online em equipe com até três outros agentes para jogabilidade cooperativa fluida.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cenário Avançado Robusto</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/d959c983f098d649ed03faa1ad8f2745.poster.avif?t=1782421726\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/d959c983f098d649ed03faa1ad8f2745.webm?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/d959c983f098d649ed03faa1ad8f2745.mp4?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Leve a sua composição ao limite e enfrente os desafios mais difíceis para obter equipamento com nível do cenário avançado. Teste seu agente em atividades de alto risco como a Zona Cega, um ambiente PvP e PvE onde os melhores saques e as maiores traições aguardam por você. <br><br>Tom Clancy’s The Division é um jogo exclusivamente online. É preciso ter uma conexão contínua com a internet para baixar e jogar.",
            "about_the_game": "Restaure a ordem e construa a Cidade de Nova York depois de uma pandemia devastadora neste jogo de tiro tático de mundo aberto em terceira pessoa:<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Combate Tático</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/961b4fc08fadd20bc0e80bf70290b55f.poster.avif?t=1782421726\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/961b4fc08fadd20bc0e80bf70290b55f.webm?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/961b4fc08fadd20bc0e80bf70290b55f.mp4?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Mobilize-se contra inimigos em tiroteios intensos com cobertura onde o posicionamento inteligente e uso de utilidade vencem batalhas.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progressão Extensa de Equipamento</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/58dda64d84fee72b78a5af315ffeaa76.poster.avif?t=1782421726\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/58dda64d84fee72b78a5af315ffeaa76.webm?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/58dda64d84fee72b78a5af315ffeaa76.mp4?t=1782421726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Saqueie, fabrique e melhore armas e blindagem para criar o agente definitivo para o seu estilo de jogo.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mundo Aberto Envolvente</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/365590/extras/19461dbf29675f9f5febc2c